15) CAP + CONSISTENCY TRADEOFFS
==============================================================================

During network partition:

Option A:
continue serving stale routing
→ Availability high
→ possible stale reads/writes

Option B:
block until metadata quorum
→ strong consistency
→ lower availability

Cassandra style:
AP leaning

Spanner style:
CP leaning metadata

Golden line:
> partition map freshness itself is a CAP tradeoff.

